    "created_at": "2016-01-05T13:59:59Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-01-05T13:59:59Z",
    "body": "Why is this different than handling of white-space? XML parsing in the DOM is very funky to attempt to preserve the white-space. https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Document_Object_Model/Whitespace_in_the_DOM\n\nI don't see why CDATA should be any less important.\n",
