    "created_at": "2016-01-05T14:04:08Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-01-05T14:04:08Z",
    "body": "Because CDATA is syntax, not content. See e.g., the definition of canonical XML. Anyway, it doesn't really matter, we most likely have to reintroduce CDATA nodes due to web content.\n",
