    "body": "@Harbs There was the idea to expose boolean attribute `Text.serializeAsCDATA` so after removing CDATASection (as unnecessary type of node) you could still use functionality of CDATASection by using Text node (old P&S spec https://rawgit.com/whatwg/domparsing/edc795ccfdc03e396197bf81a0f550105930e90b/source.html). But it ended up being just an idea.\nNext infos you can get on this still open bug (or others internal cited bugs) https://www.w3.org/Bugs/Public/show_bug.cgi?id=27386\n",
